/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Characteristics\040of\040flow\040over\040inclined\040bodies\040of\040revolution)
/Author (H\056\040Julian\040Allen\054\040Edward\040W\056\040Perkins)
/Subject (Experimental\040force\054\040moment\054\040and\040center\055of\055pressure\040variations\040for\040a\040large\040number\040of\040bodies\040of\040revolution\040have\040been\040compared\040with\040the\040calculated\040characteristics\040based\040on\040the\040approximate\040theory\040developed\040in\040NACA\055RM\055A9I26\056\040The\040bodies\040varied\040in\040fineness\040ratio\040from\0404\0565\040to\04021\0561\054\040from\040blunt\040unboattailed\040bodies\040to\040airship\040hulls\054\040and\040the\040experimental\040results\040are\040given\040for\040widely\040varying\040Mach\040number\040ranges\040of\040angle\040of\040attack\056\040It\040is\040shown\040that\040the\040lift\040and\040drag\040characteristics\040are\040fairly\040accurately\040predicted\040by\040the\040theory\040but\040that\040the\040actual\040center\040of\040pressure\040is\040more\040rearward\040than\040the\040theory\040indicates\056\040Experimental\040pressure\040distributions\040and\040visual\055flow\040studies\040which\040have\040been\040used\040to\040investigate\040the\040characteristics\040of\040the\040cross\040flow\040for\040inclined\040bodies\040of\040revolution\040have\040demonstrated\040that\040the\040development\040of\040the\040cross\040flow\040with\040distance\040along\040the\040body\040on\040a\040long\040body\040of\040constant\040about\040a\040circular\040cylinder\040impulsively\040started\040from\040rest\056\040This\040factor\040assists\040in\040explaining\040the\040observed\040differences\040between\040center\055of\055pressure\040location\040determined\040from\040experiment\040and\040that\040calculated\040using\040the\040approximate\040theory\056)
/Keywords (05\040Mar\0401951\054\040Fineness\040ratio\054\040Angle\040of\040attack\054\040Lift\055to\055drag\040ratio\054\040Aerodynamics\054\040Mach\040number)
>>
